<!-- Fragment of Spider-Man for the wiki pages Commands / Commands-HE (3.0). Format: see Home.row (`<!-- en: where -->` and `<!-- he: where -->` blocks). -->

<!-- en: the table "Powers" (the `<power>` argument), after the phoenix row -->
| `spider_man` | [Spider-Man](Spider-Man) |

<!-- en: the table "Looks", after the Phoenix row -->
| Spider-Man | `homemade`, `iron_spider`, `brand_new_day`, `own` |

<!-- en: the table "Examples" -->
| `/enhanced power set Steve spider_man iron_spider` | Makes Steve Spider-Man, in the Iron Spider suit. |

<!-- he: the table "כוחות" (the `<power>` argument), after the phoenix row -->
| `spider_man` | [ספיידרמן](Spider-Man-HE) |

<!-- he: the table "מראות", after the Phoenix row -->
| ספיידרמן | `homemade`, `iron_spider`, `brand_new_day`, `own` |

<!-- he: the table "דוגמאות" -->
| `/enhanced power set Steve spider_man iron_spider` | הופכת את סטיב לספיידרמן, בחליפת איירון ספיידר. |
